      "html": "<div class=\"bg-chalk w-full\" data-v-7c7ec91f><section id=\"section-retail-solution\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-16 py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"industry-grid__row grid w-full gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-76bbf753><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-76bbf753><span class=\"industry-section-header__dot shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-76bbf753></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-76bbf753>Solution</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-section-header__headline text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-76bbf753>Turn AI into measurable business impact.</h2><p class=\"max-w-prose text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-76bbf753>We build AI into the workflows that already run your business, helping teams sell more, serve customers faster, reduce manual work and make better commercial decisions.</p></div><ul class=\"industry-grid__items--three industry-grid__items grid w-full items-start gap-x-16 gap-y-14\" data-v-7c7ec91f><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Increase customer loyalty</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Use customer, product and interaction data to deliver more relevant recommendations, offers and experiences that keep customers coming back.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Automate retail operations</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Automate repetitive work across customer service, operations and commercial teams, reducing manual effort, speeding up processes and freeing people to focus on higher-value work.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Create better retail experiences</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Build AI into customer and employee experiences to help people find products, get answers, make decisions and get work done faster.</p></li></ul></div></div></section></div>"
