      "html": "<div class=\"bg-soft-grey w-full py-32\" data-v-ea3f4af8><section id=\"section-retail-shift\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-16 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-ea3f4af8 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" data-v-ea3f4af8 data-v-76bbf753><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-76bbf753><span class=\"industry-section-header__dot shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-76bbf753></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-76bbf753>The Shift</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-section-header__headline text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-76bbf753>From disconnected tools to connected retail intelligence.</h2></div><div class=\"list-columns__layout grid w-full items-start\" data-v-ea3f4af8><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-v-ea3f4af8><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8>The problem</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3.5\" data-v-ea3f4af8><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>Your teams have data everywhere but still can't get a complete picture.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>You've added AI tools, but the processes haven't really changed.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>You're automating individual tasks, but the wider journey is still manual.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>You're investing in AI, but struggling to link it to revenue, cost savings or customer outcomes.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-v-ea3f4af8><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8>The opportunity</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3.5\" data-v-ea3f4af8><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>Connect the information needed around the workflow.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>Redesign the workflow around what AI can actually do.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>Connect agents, systems and people across the workflow.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-ea3f4af8><span class=\"mt-3 block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-ea3f4af8></span><span data-v-ea3f4af8>Build AI around measurable outcomes such as increased revenue, lower costs and better customer experiences.</span></li></ul></div></div></section></div>"
