      "html": "<div class=\"bg-light-page w-full\" data-v-7c7ec91f><section id=\"section-retail-help\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-16 py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"industry-grid__row grid w-full gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-76bbf753><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-76bbf753><span class=\"industry-section-header__dot shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-76bbf753></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-76bbf753>How Fyntix helps</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-section-header__headline text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-76bbf753>We help retail businesses use AI to increase revenue, improve customer experiences and automate operations.</h2></div><ul class=\"industry-grid__items--three industry-grid__items grid w-full items-start gap-x-16 gap-y-14\" data-v-7c7ec91f><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>AI workflow services</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Identify high-value processes, redesign how they should work with AI, and build the agents and integrations that automate work, reduce costs and speed up execution.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>AI product development</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Build new AI-powered products and customer experiences, or add AI to existing platforms to increase conversion, improve loyalty and create new revenue streams.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Customer &amp; commercial intelligence</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Connect the data teams need to understand customers, identify opportunities and make better decisions across sales, marketing and operations.</p></li></ul></div></div></section></div>"
